# Changelog

When a change is user-visible, update `CHANGELOG.md` and the version in `Cargo.toml` in the same edit.

- Follow Keep a Changelog and Semantic Versioning.
- Bump the patch number for a fix, the minor number for a feature, and the major number for a breaking change.
- Move the bullets out of `## [Unreleased]` into `## [x.y.z] - YYYY-MM-DD`. Newest version first.
- Leave an empty `## [Unreleased]` section for the next edit.
- Use `### Added`, `### Changed`, `### Fixed`, or `### Removed`.
- Put the newest bullet at the top of its group.
- Write what the person using the app will notice.
- Record behavior, UI, install, and bug fixes.
- Skip comment-only edits, formatting, and refactors with no user-visible effect.

```markdown
## [Unreleased]

## [0.1.6] - 2026-10-20

### Fixed

- Holding a favorite and dropping it groups or reorders that show.
```
